<p>The fact that Python has great data manipulation and visualization libraries like Pandas and Matplotlib makes it easy for us to clean data and visualize the various aspects of the process. Lastly, the great thing is that if you learn to implement a logistic regression machine-learning model in Python, you can easily use that knowledge and implement other machine-learning algorithms.</p>
