<ul>
<li><strong>Business Analytics:</strong> </li>
</ul>
<p>If you’re wondering about ‘knowing to code’, let me tell you – you need not be a coding genius to apply for a <a href="https://www.analytixlabs.co.in/blog/business-analytics-career/">business analyst role</a> but a minimal knowledge of tools like R, SQL, SAS will help you shape your career as an analyst. Know everything about business analytics in <a href="https://www.analytixlabs.co.in/blog/the-abc-of-business-analytics/">The ABC of business analytics.</a> Job roles you can explore: </p>
